          "-                        Hacker News discussions reveal AI coding tools can act as large accelerators but require proper workflow integration. Some reports suggest teams may be 76% faster with AI tools but with 100% more bugs. Concerns about accumulating technical debt rather than true productivity gains. The consensus suggests effectiveness depends heavily on proper integration and human oversight.",
